nce (responds to unexpected events adequately). Crew cooperation: \"loner\", \"moody\", \"know-it-all\", \"hot temper\", \"relatively weak leadership\" suggests poor crew cooperation. So we have observations: stress resilience: responds adequately to unexpected events (implies some resilience). Crew cooperation: considered a loner, moody, know-it-all, weak leadership, hot temper, which are negative for cooperation. So answer: Yes, we have observations: D responds adequately to unexpected events (stress resilience) and is considered a loner/moody, which suggests limited crew cooperation. Provide that."}
